Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.00,0:01:55.44,Title,0,0,0,0,,《洛奇4》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.41,0:01:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拳王 来吧 你不是这样糟的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, champ. You ain't so bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.42,0:01:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,放马过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.20,0:01:31.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.22,0:01:50.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你输了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're out!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.44,0:01:56.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们协议过\N{\fnArial\fs30}We made a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.23,0:01:58.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但这真是太疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but this is extremely crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.62,0:02:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 精神不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's mentally irregular.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.93,0:02:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有道理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.66,0:02:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你欠我一个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You owe me a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.86,0:02:06.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但你何时想到的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, but when did you think of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.83,0:02:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,大约三年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}About three years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.60,0:02:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是太疯狂了 阿波罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is very crazy, Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.54,0:02:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 牡马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, Stallion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.67,0:02:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上次以一秒之差胜出\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won that last fight by one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.74,0:02:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You beat me by one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.37,0:02:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使聪明如我也难以应付\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very hard for a man of my intelligence to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.45,0:02:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 你不是说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it? Didn't you say afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.81,0:02:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,已学会怎样应付吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you learned how to live with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.02,0:02:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 骗你的 - 你骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I lied. - You lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.65,0:02:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么此刻你要证明给自己看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now you have to prove it to yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.52,0:02:29.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 不要电视 不要报章\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just for myself. No TV or newspapers,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只须你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.89,0:02:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是你和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing. Just you and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.89,0:02:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老人先请吧 - 随你怎说 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Age before beauty - Anything you say, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.16,0:02:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切交给我办吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do all the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.43,0:02:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是慢慢来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You better go slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.42,0:02:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不再年轻力壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't as young as springtime no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.64,0:02:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍然可以给你颜色的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still young enough to whip your butt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.30,0:02:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 你要怎样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? How will you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.71,0:02:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已把一切传授给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You taught me everything you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:49.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,几乎一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘记 你斗得狠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, you fight great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是一个斗士 准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm a great fighter, you ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.05,0:02:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Absolutely. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.38,0:02:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 牡马\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Stallion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们老了实在太可惜 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's too bad we have to get old, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.79,0:03:05.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只管出拳吧 阿波罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just keep punching, Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.99,0:03:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用摇铃吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to ring the bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.03,0:03:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.67,0:03:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,放马过来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.61,0:03:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,以你这把年纪仍能这样灵活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really move good for an older guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.01,0:03:24.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 简直可以飞 - 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look at him fly. - Look out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.41,0:03:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别给我击中\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't want any of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.25,0:03:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我找错了对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I'm in here with the wrong guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.67,0:03:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 你迟到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, you're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.34,0:03:55.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,妈妈一定会骂你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom's going to yell at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.14,0:03:58.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好吗？- 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How you doing? - Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.31,0:04:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉得有点亮了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think that's a little bright? A little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.95,0:04:03.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那帽子从何处来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you get that hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.95,0:04:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友给我的 喜欢吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend gave it to me. Like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.12,0:04:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁打了你的眼睛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who punched you in the eye?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.49,0:04:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.66,0:04:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真奇怪 快些进来 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's weird. Better hurry, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 你正养成一个大声说话的个性\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you're developing a very loud personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.13,0:04:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,别走太快 否则你会到焦点的外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go too fast or you'll get out of focus.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:22.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.64,0:04:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.71,0:04:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 时候也差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo, It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.22,0:04:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起我迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.08,0:04:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,过去那边准备吃饭 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you get ready to eat, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.81,0:04:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你回来了 不用在叫他名字了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're here. Now stop calling him name.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直在喊着我的名字？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You been calling me names?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.85,0:04:41.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们再等下去就会变成下一个生日\N{\fnArial\fs30}We wait any longer, it will be my next birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.55,0:04:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:44.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,出去打拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out getting punched.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,把蛋糕拿过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring the cake in here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.39,0:04:47.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}and let's get the celebration underway.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.59,0:04:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.16,0:04:51.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,宝贝 拿蛋糕来 他一定喜欢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Babe, get the cake. He'll love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.13,0:04:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有大惊喜给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a great surprise for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.32,0:04:53.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定喜欢这蛋糕 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll love this cake, ok?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.90,0:04:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会喜欢这份礼物的 泡利叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll love your present, Uncle Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.16,0:04:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.37,0:04:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我先营造气氛 把灯光较暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me set the mood here. I have to turn the lights down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.77,0:05:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.91,0:05:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,停在行车道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's parked in the driveway?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.61,0:05:05.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心一点好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just be patient, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.41,0:05:08.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很紧张 开始冒汗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so excited, I'm sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.45,0:05:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉着像我要打一场大的拳赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel like I'm going into a big fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.13,0:05:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,生日快乐 保利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy birthday, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.41,0:05:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your present.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.74,0:05:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要一辆跑车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted a sports car for my birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.32,0:05:41.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是一个会走路的垃圾箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a walking trash can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.98,0:05:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 它蛮不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, he looks great here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.58,0:05:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,它非常古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is extremely psycho.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.78,0:05:47.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有朋友 所以我们认为你会喜欢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since you don't have any friends, we thought you'd like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.55,0:05:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 假装开心好吗？孤单的时候它可以和你作伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Pretend you're happy. It'll keep you company when you're all alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.69,0:05:52.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看上去还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a great-looking guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.09,0:05:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,请许愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please make a wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,很可怕 它会说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's creepy! That thing talks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.63,0:05:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,可怕？它太棒了 我很希望在我成长时 就能有它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creepy? These things are great! I wish I had one when I was growing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.06,0:06:00.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像它说的 快许个愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make a wish, like he said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.33,0:06:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望没作过这噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I wasn't in this nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.40,0:06:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有格调的愿望 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}A very classy wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.50,0:06:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.07,0:06:07.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.07,0:06:10.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起吹熄蜡烛好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to help me put out this forest fire?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.28,0:06:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数三声 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the count of three. One.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.88,0:06:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.28,0:06:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.92,0:06:21.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,熄灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你淹死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You drowned me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,保利 我替你弄干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll clean it up for you, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.57,0:06:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你发觉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you noticed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你捧着那蛋糕做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing with that cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,派对还未完的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The party ain't over yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.84,0:06:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要继续庆祝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still got to celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一晚很特别\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a special night.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.81,0:06:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 是星期三\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.45,0:06:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是星期三\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's definitely Wednesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.68,0:06:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你别忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}but in case you forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.62,0:06:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们结婚已经九年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's almost been nine years since you married me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.89,0:06:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是送给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so here's your prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.09,0:06:57.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,但下星期才是我们的周年纪念\N{\fnArial\fs30}But our anniversary's a week away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.99,0:07:00.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但为何要等？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's true. But why wait?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.06,0:07:03.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它很粗糙？- 不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Has it been that rough? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是非常好 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快打开你的礼物 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open your prize. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.21,0:07:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜欢吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.78,0:07:18.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很美 - 那就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's beautiful. - All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.25,0:07:21.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知 不知有多担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was so nervous. I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.21,0:07:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖给我的那傢伙说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy I bought it from says.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.88,0:07:27.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然它看似蛇 但放心\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if it looks like a snake, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.82,0:07:30.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不会咬你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't bite you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.76,0:07:32.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,很美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.26,0:07:36.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道什么是最棒吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's amazing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.50,0:07:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过了这么多年\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all these years.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.43,0:07:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到一切仍是新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything still seems kind of new.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.07,0:07:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得很久以前 我曾告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember a long time ago I told you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.21,0:07:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说你永远甩不掉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you ain't never getting rid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.14,0:07:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.85,0:07:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的确没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.55,0:07:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永不会离开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're never getting rid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.49,0:08:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,周年纪念快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Happy almost anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.54,0:08:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可否回答一些问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you answer a few questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.27,0:08:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会逗留多久？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you here for?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.64,0:08:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟些会公布\N{\fnArial\fs30}We talk later, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.94,0:08:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡 你何时会出战？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When are you fighting, Drago?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.41,0:08:24.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟些再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}We talk it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.18,0:08:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏联真的会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it definite the Soviet Union.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.94,0:08:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入职业拳赛吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}will enter professional boxing?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.15,0:08:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,无可奉告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, no more talk now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.68,0:08:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在记者招待会公布\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will talk at press conference.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.35,0:08:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会在什么地方举行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know where it will be held?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.25,0:08:34.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟些会公布\N{\fnArial\fs30}We talk it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.07,0:08:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天或许是运动史上的一个里程碑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today may have proved to be a landmark in sports history.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,经过多年的混乱政局后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After unraveling years of red tape,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.80,0:08:53.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄罗斯终于参加竞赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russia will now throw its hat into the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.27,0:08:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,指的是职业拳击赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prize ring, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.57,0:08:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,以下由他太太积米拉来介绍她丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}The introductions were made by his wife Ludmilla Vobet Drago.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.64,0:08:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是游泳金牌得主\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was the double gold medalist in swimming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.61,0:09:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 苏联已经加入职业拳击界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today the Soviet Union has officially entered professional boxing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.65,0:09:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫就是无敌的重量级业余世界拳王\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband and great undefeated heavyweight world amateur champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.15,0:09:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Captain Ivan Drago…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.92,0:09:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他与他的教练来到美国\N{\fnArial\fs30}has come with his trainers to America.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.29,0:09:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,参予国际运动比赛和作为亲善大使\N{\fnArial\fs30}to compete as an international sportsman and ambassador of goodwill.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.83,0:09:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡有打过职业拳赛吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has Drago ever boxed against a real professional?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.37,0:09:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在俄罗斯跟享负盛名的韦曼纽训练\N{\fnArial\fs30}From having been trained in Russia by great boxing coach, Manuel Vega.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.04,0:09:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,现任教练为廉沙基 我们希望他有资格做拳王\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now by Sergei Rimsky, we hope he's qualified to do so.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.47,0:09:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hope?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.51,0:09:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,他当然有资格 但我不想说得太自信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I know he is, but I don't want to sound too confident.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.61,0:09:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,若可以的话 我们想\N{\fnArial\fs30}If possible, we would like to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.85,0:09:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他与拳王鲍洛奇进行一场表演赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}have an exhibition bout with your famous champion Rocky Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.19,0:09:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么使你认为他能迎战经验丰富的洛奇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think he can fight someone as seasoned as Balboa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.66,0:09:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有人比得上他的力量 他的耐力\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can match his strength, his endurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.43,0:09:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他的野心\N{\fnArial\fs30}or his aggressiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.03,0:09:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去他不可战胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like he's indestructible.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的确是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.33,0:09:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄罗斯猛犸象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well. Can this mammoth Russian,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.36,0:09:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个绰号「西伯利亚快车」的\N{\fnArial\fs30}already nicknamed the Siberian Express,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,能否改变重量级职业拳击的排名？\N{\fnArial\fs30}wreak havoc among the professional heavyweight ranks?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.54,0:10:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论谁是他第一个对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever he fights first,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.13,0:10:02.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那将会是场激战\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll be one hot ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.08,0:10:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来我们将报道今天职业足球赛的成绩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be right back with a check on today's pro football scoreboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.05,0:10:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我什么时侯可以学打拳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, when can I learn to fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.12,0:10:10.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听不到 你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't hear you. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.15,0:10:13.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想学打拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to learn to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.79,0:10:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,把机器人的音量调低好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you turn your robot down?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.46,0:10:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看我打拳已经足够\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see I fight,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.03,0:10:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你不用打\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you don't have to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.76,0:10:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你靠脑袋做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to use your head for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.86,0:10:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要像我这样打沙包\N{\fnArial\fs30}instead of a punching bag like I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.50,0:10:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脑袋也不像沙包\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your head doesn't look like a punching bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.80,0:10:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像吗？很感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nice. Thanks a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.94,0:10:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它像棒球接手的手套\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looks like a catcher's mitt.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.44,0:10:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,好聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}A wise guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.38,0:10:40.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴尔博亚先生 奎迪先生的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Balboa, Mr. Creed's on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上来听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? I'll be right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.73,0:10:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以在这里听\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can get it right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.75,0:10:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望不是又一场复赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope it's not another rematch.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.52,0:10:47.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.82,0:10:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么事 - 阿波罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Yeah, Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.52,0:10:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,关掉它 你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn that down. How are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.29,0:10:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？你出来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? You're coming out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.06,0:10:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 我在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great. What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.86,0:10:59.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到很眼晕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just getting dizzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.94,0:11:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫和我感谢各位来到我们的训练中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband and I thank you for coming to our training quarters today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.37,0:11:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,正如你们所见 这里非常先进\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, it is highly advanced.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.61,0:11:13.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且我们愿意让美国报界报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we wish to show the American press a small portion.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.05,0:11:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的国家在提高人类能力的技术上\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the advances our country's made.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.48,0:11:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所得到的成就\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the technology of human performance.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.82,0:11:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,廉教练 这些仪器怎样增强人的能力？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coach Rimsky, what does all this do to enhance performance?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.15,0:11:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那… - 我替你回答\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well… - If I may answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.96,0:11:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,通过激发他的全力\N{\fnArial\fs30}It makes a man a better man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.26,0:11:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将会变成更出色 无可匹敌的运动员\N{\fnArial\fs30}a great athlete a super athlete by harnessing all his strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.07,0:11:36.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然大多数国家都忽视体热学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though most of the world is ignorant in body chemistry,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.34,0:11:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们希望把这知识灌输给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}we wish to educate your country.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.81,0:11:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,谣传苏联运动员使用兴奋剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}There have been rumors of doping.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.90,0:11:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,和注射合成代谢类固醇\N{\fnArial\fs30}and distribution of anabolic steroids in the Soviet Union.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.34,0:11:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡有参与这些实验吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has Drago partaken in any such experiments?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.68,0:11:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 伊凡是采用自然训练法的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Ivan in naturally trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.35,0:11:52.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你怎解释他异常的力量？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how do you explain his freakish strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.59,0:11:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,像大力水手一样 他每天都吃菠菜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like your Popeye, he ate his spinach every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,要示范一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall we have a demonstration?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.93,0:12:02.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please do. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.76,0:12:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个正常重量级拳手\N{\fnArial\fs30}A normal heavyweight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,每平方英寸能击出700磅力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}averages 700 pounds of pressure per square inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.81,0:12:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡做出1850磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago averages 1850 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.48,0:12:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以结果显而易见\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the result is quite obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.35,0:12:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么结果呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What results are those?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.22,0:12:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论他打什么 都会被毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever he hits, he destroys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.53,0:12:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很高大强壮 但也笨拙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's big and he's strong, but he's clumsy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.53,0:12:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我可以击败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I can beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.87,0:12:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何又想打拳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you want to fight again?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.97,0:12:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我一种信念\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's something I believe in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.24,0:12:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去做功课\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do your homework.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.24,0:12:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 迟些见 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Later, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.91,0:12:49.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚会见 叔叔们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Later, Uncle Paulie, Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.98,0:12:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一会儿见 大人物 - 一会儿见 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Later, big man. - See you later, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.21,0:12:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认为大家都期望见到洛奇第一个击倒他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think people are expecting to see Rocky whack this bum out first?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.75,0:13:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 到真正比赛时会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and he will when it's for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.02,0:13:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这只是表演赛 不是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just an exhibition bout. It's kid stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.49,0:13:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那目的是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.83,0:13:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么值得去受伤？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's worth getting hurt for?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.90,0:13:14.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我女朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.11,0:13:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 宝贝 - 别客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks, honey. - You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.68,0:13:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这首歌很好听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice song.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.84,0:13:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我最喜欢的 你是最棒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my favorite. You're the greatest.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.75,0:13:29.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you, sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.45,0:13:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.58,0:13:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,保利 谁教它这样说话的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paulie, who taught it to talk like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.72,0:13:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,她爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She loves me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.60,0:13:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I was saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.66,0:13:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会让这个大肆宣传的傻瓜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want this chump to come here with all that hype.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.93,0:13:49.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,使我们被看扁\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to make us look bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.23,0:13:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们出尽各种花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}They try every other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.24,0:13:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,在洛奇协助下 我们会得到传媒报导\N{\fnArial\fs30}With Rock's help, we can get great media coverage,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:55.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,使他们被比下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make them look bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.84,0:13:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样做不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.98,0:13:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么比这做得更对\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never been more right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.41,0:14:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个出色的拳手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a great fighter,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.83,0:14:02.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你已经退役5年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you've been retired for five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.38,0:14:05.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不觉着是时候想想其他事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you think it's time to think about something else?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还可以捱多少拳？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How much can you take?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.69,0:14:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.16,0:14:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去冲咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get the coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.36,0:14:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我没有别的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I didn't mean to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.43,0:14:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是担心你俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just care about you both.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.91,0:14:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,有看过这些漫画吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever try these comics?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.01,0:14:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,能让你保持生殖力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keeps your fertility.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.41,0:14:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,保利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.89,0:14:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这比赛真精彩\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was a great fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.66,0:14:46.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,精彩？我快被打晕了 你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great? I'm getting punchy just watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.19,0:14:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的下巴怎会被打中的 杜马\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you using for a chin there, Stallion?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.80,0:14:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该闪过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have slipped that one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.34,0:14:55.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你绝对闪得过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, You definitely should have slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.70,0:15:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 你在拳台上流血时人们对你很疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's crazy how people care about you when you're in that ring bleeding,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.81,0:15:04.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一旦你踏出擂台 你就变成历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}but once you step out of that ring, you're ancient history.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.11,0:15:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ain't ancient history.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.88,0:15:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人向我要签名\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody's asking for autographs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.58,0:15:14.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波罗 可以问你些事情吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apollo, Can I ask you something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.69,0:15:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.89,0:15:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白要跟伊凡打的拳赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this fight you're having against the Russian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.89,0:15:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实并非真的要对付他？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think maybe it ain't against him?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.70,0:15:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他 那是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it's not him, then who is it against?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.63,0:15:32.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,会不会是你自己对自己？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think maybe it's like you against you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.81,0:15:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然不是 我觉着你大脑确实受伤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I think you really are getting brain damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:36.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的这样想\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.44,0:15:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, maybe, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.68,0:15:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波罗 我不是说笑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm speaking the truth, Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.31,0:15:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.45,0:15:45.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想听到这样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I want to hear this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.55,0:15:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,得了 阿波罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.19,0:15:49.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个出色的拳手 毋庸置疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're a great fighter. No doubt about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.36,0:15:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们也必须面对现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we have to face the facts too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.26,0:15:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不想相信 但那的确已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to believe it, but maybe the show is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.99,0:15:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得容易 因为你仍然是拳王\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's easy for you to say. You're still on top.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.23,0:16:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你不再是拳王时 你会怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens when you're not on top? Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.33,0:16:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会到什么地方？因为我们不会再重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we go? We sure can't be born again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.17,0:16:10.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 但是我们有时可以转变的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know we can't be born again, but we have to change sometime.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.34,0:16:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想变 我喜欢当拳手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to change! I like who I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.01,0:16:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也喜欢你当拳手 但你想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like who you are too, but look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.75,0:16:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使你不想相信 也改变不了现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want to believe this, but that ain't us no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.82,0:16:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法再像以前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't do that the way we did before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.36,0:16:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在变 我们在变回正常人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're changing. We're turning into regular people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.79,0:16:28.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 或者你以为你在变\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, maybe you think you're changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.73,0:16:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你无法改变你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you can't change what you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.10,0:16:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会忘记奖金等东西 什么也没改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget all this money and stuff around you. It don't change a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.70,0:16:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你与我甚至都没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and me don't even have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.77,0:16:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们天生残酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're born with a killer instinct,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.84,0:16:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能像收音机那样随便开关的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't turn off and on like a radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.58,0:16:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须作战 因为我们是战士\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to be in the middle of the action because we're warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.22,0:16:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有挑战 没有战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without some challenge, without some war to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.39,0:16:56.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,战士就跟死人没分别\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the warrior may as well be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.83,0:17:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我请求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm asking you,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.00,0:17:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,作为一个朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.73,0:17:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次支持我\N{\fnArial\fs30}stand by my side this one last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.77,0:17:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的口才真了得 阿波罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a great talker, Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.15,0:17:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但这何时完结\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, but when this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.22,0:17:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最了解我的 杜马\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know me, Stallion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.79,0:17:30.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我总是想到别的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always think of something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.39,0:17:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才使我害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm afraid of.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.02,0:17:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我答应你\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.73,0:17:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为那傢伙感到遗憾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel sorry for that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.03,0:17:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何决定 跟伊凡进行表演赛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apollo, what made you decide to put on an exhibition with Drago?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一种责任感吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call it a sense of responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.81,0:17:47.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,责任感 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Responsibility, how?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.77,0:17:51.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须教这小子 如何打美式拳击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to teach this young fellow how to box American style.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.71,0:17:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡不是欠缺一些经验吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't Drago a little inexperienced to be in the same ring?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.11,0:17:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些傢伙要从苦中学习的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some folks have to learn the hard way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.65,0:18:01.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会立即把他击倒？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No knockout prediction?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.65,0:18:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他没使我恼火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not angry with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.16,0:18:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想让全世界知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to show the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.89,0:18:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄罗斯没有拥有最好的运动员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Russia doesn't have all the best athletes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.39,0:18:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇 你赞成阿波罗跟伊凡对赛吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you think Apollo should fight Drago?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.00,0:18:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我个人认为 最重要的是你需要个梯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Personally, the first thing you need is a ladder.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.47,0:18:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡 要跟前拳王比赛有什么感觉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does it feel to spar with the great former champion?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.28,0:18:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没带舌头到美国来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man's tongue didn't come through customs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.62,0:18:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我丈夫很高兴有这个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}My husband is very happy to have this opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.38,0:18:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是他的梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's his dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.82,0:18:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,梦想 这是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dream. How do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.42,0:18:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波罗这名字在俄罗斯 是很出名和备受尊崇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In our country, Apollo Creed is well-known and very respected.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.49,0:18:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次可是我们的胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could be a good victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.93,0:18:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一等 胜利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute. Win?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是认为可以打败我吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't really think you're going to whip me, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.27,0:18:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来不是为了输的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't come here to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.87,0:18:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 你等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hold on, little lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.94,0:18:55.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他将会败给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lose and lose royally he will do.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.61,0:18:56.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何这样肯定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How can you be so sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.88,0:18:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾跟最出色的拳手比赛 他曾打败他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been with best, I've beaten the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.31,0:19:02.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打败过的人比社会保障下还多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've retired more men than Social Security.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.45,0:19:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.83,0:19:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,似乎你不是太现实 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not very realistic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.39,0:19:07.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是什么人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:08.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.52,0:19:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是懂拳击\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can box, yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.73,0:19:12.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你太老了 不是伊凡对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you are far too old to think you can win over Drago.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.53,0:19:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.76,0:19:15.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这是残酷的事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and it could be a painful one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把这个没蛋蛋的木头人到拳场\N{\fnArial\fs30}You put that heavy bag without balls in the ring with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.73,0:19:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就明白什么叫残酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you'll see the meaning of pain!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.60,0:19:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何侮辱我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you insult us?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.30,0:19:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just hold on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.77,0:19:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要逼我做坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me out as the bad guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.33,0:19:26.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来是谈友谊赛 直到你先挑衅\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to talk about a friendly exhibition bout till you started up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.64,0:19:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,惹事的是这位多嘴同志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come right the big mouth body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 挑衅的是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are the aggressor! This is obvious!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.84,0:19:33.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位传媒朋友 在公平起见下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish to say to the press in all fairness,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.75,0:19:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡不应跟这个人比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago should not even fight this man,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.55,0:19:37.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他已经过时！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is a has-been!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.42,0:19:40.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,立刻叫那木头跟我到拳场！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get that big chump in the ring right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.72,0:19:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他来 我不想听她说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it on. I don't want to hear her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.76,0:19:47.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫那笨蛋来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let that chump go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.73,0:19:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.70,0:19:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已说出我的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said what I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.40,0:19:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,擂台上自会分出胜负\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll finish this in the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 明白吗 - 随你喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You understand? - Whatever you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.47,0:20:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,住口 还有你带来的这些傀儡也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and all your puppets just shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.04,0:20:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才过时 木头人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are history, chump.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.44,0:20:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.41,0:20:05.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,吵了少许\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little loud for my taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.61,0:20:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但不错吧 - 非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But good? - Yeah, very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.79,0:20:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎各位来到灯光之城\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome one and all to the city of lights.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.91,0:20:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉斯维加斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Las Vegas,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.12,0:20:18.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,参予这次特别盛事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one of the most unusual events in years.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.08,0:20:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,东西方对对碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}East meets West.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.63,0:20:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,老手与新手进行一场友谊拳赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Age versus youth in a goodwill exhibition match.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.30,0:20:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,前拳王阿波罗奎迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the former champion Apollo Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.43,0:20:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,对来自苏联 满身肌肉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}takes on a mountain of muscle from the Soviet Union.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.10,0:20:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ivan Drago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.44,0:20:33.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 - 忍耐是美德\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Patience is a virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.77,0:20:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已准备出击\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm ready to rock and roll.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.24,0:20:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白 但你先要拿装备 可以了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand, but you need your equipment. There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.51,0:20:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看似木乃伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you look like a mummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.41,0:20:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我像木乃伊 - 感到怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I feel like a mummy. - Does it feel okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.28,0:20:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 连钉子也可吞下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It feels great. I could eat nails.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.78,0:20:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没有吃过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never tried them things.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.95,0:20:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.29,0:20:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没吃过蜗牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never had snails.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.43,0:20:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在花园见过蜗牛 但我从没吃过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seen them in the garden, but I never wanted to eat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.36,0:20:55.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说蜗牛 我说钉子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't say anything about snails. I said, "nails, "
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.59,0:20:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,钉子 杜马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nail. Stallion. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.03,0:21:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你状态很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.73,0:21:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当比赛开始时 答应我一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but do me a favor when you go up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.57,0:21:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要逞强 可以吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try not to wear yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.61,0:21:08.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,逞强 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, wear myself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.61,0:21:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你已经五年没有比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that you haven't been in the ring for five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.64,0:21:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我只想你保持\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to maintain a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.35,0:21:16.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我不是老头子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sound like I'm an old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:18.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正处于最佳状态 更强壮 反应更快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm in the best shape of my life. I'm stronger. I'm quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.68,0:21:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是说你不在状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not saying you're not ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.89,0:21:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,但换了是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but, personally, if it were me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.19,0:21:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会押后数星期才比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't mind postponing it a couple weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.39,0:21:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 押后？- 对 我指\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Postpone? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.73,0:21:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对这小子毫不认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, we don't really know anything about this guy you're fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.50,0:21:38.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 即使我说押后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's say I postpone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.14,0:21:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我退出 让别人跟这个木头打\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pull out, somebody else steps in and whips this chump.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.44,0:21:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那我怎样 - 你是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where does that leave me? - What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.74,0:21:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只不过是表演赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just some exhibition fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.50,0:21:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么大不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This don't mean nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.71,0:21:48.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你这样想就错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that's where you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.05,0:21:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是一场无关痛痒的表演赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not just an exhibition that doesn't mean anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.58,0:21:54.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要对付他们 你明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is us against them. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.39,0:21:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,牡马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stallion.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.62,0:22:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,此刻你或许不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.83,0:22:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在说的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}what I'm talking about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.00,0:22:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但当比赛完了你就会明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you will when it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.30,0:22:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 到时你会明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, you will when it's over!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.48,0:22:20.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.91,0:22:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.04,0:22:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望赛后我们可以做朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope after we can be friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.45,0:22:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.51,0:22:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.51,0:23:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是运动员 而不是士兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're sportsmen, not soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.55,0:23:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢欣赏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enjoy the fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.69,0:26:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 晚上好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.69,0:26:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赖士图与禾华纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Along with Warner Wolf, I'm Stu Nahan.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.79,0:26:26.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎大家收看这场特别盛事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We welcome you to a most unusual event.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.59,0:26:28.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是职业拳击界史上\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.12,0:26:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,首次东西对垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}West against East in professional sports.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.33,0:26:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你支持我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for getting me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.83,0:26:33.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我欠你一个人情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.43,0:26:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 大家打平了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're even.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.70,0:26:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到重生一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I feel born again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.64,0:26:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 欢迎各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.91,0:26:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,有请我们真正的拳王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would like to announce the presence of a true fighting champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.21,0:26:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,充分表现「坚毅」二字的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that defines the word courage.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.85,0:26:50.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,意大利牡马鲍洛奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Italian Stallion, Rocky Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.32,0:26:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me, would you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.55,0:26:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.46,0:26:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.40,0:27:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚的特别赛事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight's special event features.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.33,0:27:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两位特别的选手\N{\fnArial\fs30}two great athletes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.53,0:27:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在蓝色场角的是体重221磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the blue corner weighing 221 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.97,0:27:16.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,前世界重量级拳王\N{\fnArial\fs30}the former heavyweight champion of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.07,0:27:18.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳跃的毁灭者\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Dancing Destroyer.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.58,0:27:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,刺痛之王\N{\fnArial\fs30}the King of Sting.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.01,0:27:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,拳击伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Count of Monte Fisto.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.68,0:27:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么多绰号\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you have enough names?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.02,0:27:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心一点 快读完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be patient. We're almost done.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.12,0:27:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,灾难大师 独一无二的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Master of Disaster, the one and only.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.92,0:27:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波罗 奎迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apollo Creed!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.56,0:27:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众都期待一场激战\N{\fnArial\fs30}The crowd anticipating a great fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.73,0:27:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波罗已在台上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apollo is playing to the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.67,0:27:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,在红色场角的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the red corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.74,0:27:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是体重261磅\N{\fnArial\fs30}weighing an even 261 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.21,0:27:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,金牌得主 兼长胜的业余世界冠军\N{\fnArial\fs30}gold medalist and undefeated world amateur champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.51,0:27:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自苏联的\N{\fnArial\fs30}from the Soviet Union.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.28,0:28:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,西伯利亚火牛\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Siberian Bull.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.32,0:28:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ivan Drago!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.73,0:28:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃定你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.86,0:28:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃定你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.10,0:28:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位拳手都走到擂台中央\N{\fnArial\fs30}The two fighters come to the center of the ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.33,0:28:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听候裁判费路的指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}for the instructions from referee Lou Filippo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.90,0:28:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们已明白规例\N{\fnArial\fs30}You boys know the rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.40,0:28:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许击打腰部以下 肾部 后脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch your low blows, kidney punches, rabbit punches.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.67,0:28:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,若把对方击倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}In case of a knockdown,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.73,0:28:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要返回场角\N{\fnArial\fs30}you go to the corner I tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.31,0:28:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,直至听到我指示才出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you stay there until I tell you to come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.41,0:28:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,双方握手 公平决斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shake hands and let's have a good fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.35,0:28:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候好好学习了 小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to go to school, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.12,0:28:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,提起双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.34,0:28:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要个翻译吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you need an interpreter?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.78,0:28:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,是时候学习\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to go to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.39,0:28:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会输\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.89,0:28:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.93,0:28:43.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们之间的仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bad blood between these two.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.34,0:28:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,弥漫着整个场馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}can be felt all over this arena.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.13,0:28:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位俄罗斯人的身型让我惊讶\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't get over the size of this Russian.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.64,0:28:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我表现吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's show time!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.71,0:28:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.73,0:28:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你忘记了戴？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you forget something?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.38,0:28:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.68,0:29:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波罗今晚似乎斗志高昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apollo seems to be in great spirits tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.98,0:29:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的没叫观众失望\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's really putting on a show for this capacity crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.28,0:29:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍后回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be back in a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.95,0:29:10.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一回合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Round one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.92,0:29:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪轻快地移动 现在向后移\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creed dancing around Creed backpedaling now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.96,0:29:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已经五年没比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's been away five years.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.76,0:29:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别等他 先出击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't wait him, get out first.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.07,0:29:23.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.97,0:29:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.37,0:29:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,两位拳手都来进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither fighter ready to throw a punch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.17,0:29:30.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,左刺拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}A left jab there.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.43,0:29:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪再挥左刺拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}A left jab once again by Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.38,0:29:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪滑了一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}A slip by Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.72,0:29:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,真古怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is bizarre.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.25,0:29:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪是拳王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creed is over the hill,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.48,0:29:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这个俄罗斯人则从没比赛过\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Russian hasn't fought anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.90,0:29:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停下来 刺拳打他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep moving! Stick him! Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.50,0:29:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡再次进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago moving in again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.07,0:29:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪再挥出左拳 伊凡避开\N{\fnArial\fs30}A left hand by Creed and another. Drago moves away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.94,0:30:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.64,0:30:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,出拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.55,0:30:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪再次挥出左拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another left hand by Creed!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.97,0:30:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡在伺机用右手攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago waiting, cocking that right hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.26,0:30:19.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快避开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out there!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.26,0:30:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,避开他 别靠近他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.29,0:30:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来一个左拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a left hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.69,0:30:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在不断狂揍！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's taking some punishment now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.90,0:30:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡迫使他到围绳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago moves him against the ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.63,0:30:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他脱身！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tie him up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.20,0:30:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡把奎迪逼到另一边！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the Russian throws Creed across the ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.40,0:30:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.14,0:30:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡挥出上勾拳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is Drago with the upper hand!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.34,0:30:36.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他再用左拳击中上腹！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago with a left to the midsection!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.54,0:30:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走到中间！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of that corner!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.74,0:30:39.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡不断挥出右拳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another right and another right!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.48,0:30:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,又挥出另一个右拳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another right, another right!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.42,0:30:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但奎迪已被逼到围绳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creed is against the ropes!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.02,0:30:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们上台阻止他们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}They step in and stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.09,0:30:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.09,0:30:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是一场表演赛 明白吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is supposed to be an exhibition! You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.89,0:30:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是表演赛！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just an exhibition!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.49,0:30:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡漂亮地赛完第一回合\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tremendous end to the first round by the Russian.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.23,0:31:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波罗血流满面\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a very bloody Apollo Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.27,0:31:05.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位苏联拳手的力量真惊人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Soviet's strength is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.74,0:31:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要终止比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champ, I have to stop you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.61,0:31:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这拳赛已完结 我要终止它\N{\fnArial\fs30}This fight's finished. I have to call it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.07,0:31:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法再继续比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Champ, you can't do no more out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.98,0:31:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来是拳斗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.08,0:31:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要打死你 我得阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's killing you. I have to stop this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.98,0:31:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.92,0:31:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,答应我不要终止赛事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me you won't stop this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.12,0:31:21.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是前拳王灾难性的一个回合\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a pulverizing round for the ex-champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.79,0:31:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡果然很认真\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ivan Drago is definitely for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.06,0:31:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论怎样 不要终止比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stop this fight no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.53,0:31:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.68,0:31:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪迎战第二回合 他在轻快移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creed comes out for round two, dancing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.65,0:31:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,双脚似乎仍充满弹跳力\N{\fnArial\fs30}The legs appear to be still a little rubbery.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.52,0:31:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,提起双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.22,0:31:54.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,提起双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your hands up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.09,0:31:57.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡未有行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it is the Russian just standing there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.39,0:32:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他企图恫吓奎迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Russian trying to intimidate Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.76,0:32:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡以右拳还击 奎迪摇摇摆摆\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Russian throws a right hand and staggers Creed!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.99,0:32:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一个击中奎迪的下颚！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another right to the jaw!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.20,0:32:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,再用左拳打其头部！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A left to the head!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.44,0:32:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡完全不手下留情！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creed is being pounded without mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.14,0:32:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再打！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.64,0:32:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,裁判企图阻止\N{\fnArial\fs30}The referee tries to step in.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.74,0:32:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被撵到另一边\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's thrown across the ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.71,0:32:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,抛毛巾！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw the towel!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.45,0:32:23.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.88,0:32:26.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过阿波罗这样捱打！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have never seen Apollo take so much punishment!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.35,0:32:27.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,把毛巾抛出！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw the damn towel!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.85,0:32:28.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.39,0:32:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.04,0:32:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.87,0:32:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪倒下来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creed is down!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.01,0:32:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波罗倒下来 他可能受重伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apollo could be badly hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.55,0:32:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他透透气！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.75,0:32:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让开 - 叫他们退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get move back. - Get these guys out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.85,0:33:00.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜出的是伊凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}The winner: Ivan Drago.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.19,0:33:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我过去 阿波罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me through! Apollo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.52,0:33:04.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不会给打败的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot be defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.26,0:33:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他没事吗？- 快找医生来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he okay? - Somebody get a doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.59,0:33:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,奎迪没动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no movement by Creed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.39,0:33:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把灯关掉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get that light off him!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.46,0:33:11.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打败所有人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I defeat all men.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.20,0:33:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他死了吗？- 走开！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is he dead? - Get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.20,0:33:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,现场一片混乱！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's absolute pandemonium!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.37,0:33:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,请退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand back.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.37,0:33:17.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他透气 阿波罗！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.90,0:33:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.94,0:33:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.44,0:33:22.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就会打败真正拳王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I defeat real champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.27,0:33:24.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,担架呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the stretcher?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.58,0:33:25.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let him breathe!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.98,0:33:29.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来是以喜剧开场 最后却以悲剧收场\N{\fnArial\fs30}What started out as a joke has turned out to be a disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.65,0:33:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的伤势似乎很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creed appears to be in very serious condition.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.88,0:33:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,他仍活着吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the man alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.92,0:33:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的 阿波罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can make it, Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.49,0:33:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要死就死了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he dies, he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.64,0:34:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有好多关于这个人的话可说\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot I could say about this man.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.41,0:34:04.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在都不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if it matters now.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.62,0:34:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,重要的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess what matters is.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.39,0:34:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,他代表的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what he stood for.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.96,0:34:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为了什么而活\N{\fnArial\fs30}what he lived for.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.69,0:34:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,及他为了什么而死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and what he died for.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.17,0:34:22.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做所有的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always did everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.20,0:34:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是按你喜欢的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way you wanted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.54,0:34:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时我不明白 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't understand that, but.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.85,0:34:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}now I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.99,0:34:48.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永不会忘记你 阿波罗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never forget you, Apollo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.58,0:35:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是最优秀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.36,0:35:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇 这是最后决定吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky, is the decision final?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.83,0:35:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.16,0:35:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是首次有拳王放弃名衔吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the first to give up his crown?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.83,0:35:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.00,0:35:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,锦标对你来说还有意义吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn the title mean anything to you anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.57,0:35:31.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 直到这比赛完结\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until this is over.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.57,0:35:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,廉教练 洛奇以挥拳力量劲而著称\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coach Rimsky, considering Rocky's known punching power.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.17,0:35:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为这比赛易应付吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you still think this will be an easy fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.94,0:35:40.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 这是体型\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, of course. It's a matter of size.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.35,0:35:43.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,与进化的问题 不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and evolution. Isn't it, gentlemen?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.95,0:35:48.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡是历来训练得最完美运动员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago is the most perfectly trained athlete ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.22,0:35:51.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个傢伙根本没有那身型或耐力\N{\fnArial\fs30}This other man has not the size or the endurance.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.29,0:35:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,又或者天赋以胜出\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the genetics to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.39,0:35:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,在体力方面他根本无法取胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's physically impossible for this little man to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.23,0:36:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡是未来的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago is a look at the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.57,0:36:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点从没被提过 这拳赛有多少奖金？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's been no mention yet, but how much are you making for this fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.74,0:36:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,没奖金\N{\fnArial\fs30}No money.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.77,0:36:06.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这跟钱无关\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about money.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.97,0:36:09.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,已定了比赛日期吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has the fight date been set yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.24,0:36:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,12月25日\N{\fnArial\fs30}December 25.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.54,0:36:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何拣圣诞节？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.84,0:36:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人通知我的 - 在哪里举行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's what I was told. - Where?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.44,0:36:15.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在俄罗斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in Russia.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.65,0:36:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you nuts?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.85,0:36:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.21,0:36:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何答应？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you agree to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.42,0:36:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了在苏联 没有其他地方可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fight in Soviet Union or we fight nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.02,0:36:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你们不问伊凡的妻子为何害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you ask Drago's wife why she is afraid?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:26.05,0:36:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉他们为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell them, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.29,0:36:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怕我丈夫有生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid for my husband's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.09,0:36:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,到处都有暴力恐吓\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have threats of violence everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.63,0:36:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是政客\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not in politics.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.17,0:36:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想我丈夫安全并获公平对待\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I want is for my husband to be safe, to be treated fairly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.74,0:36:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们叫他做杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call him a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.10,0:36:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是职业拳手 不是杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a professional fighter, not a killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.41,0:36:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们深信比我们优秀\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have this belief that you are better than us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.98,0:36:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们深信这国家非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have this belief that this country is so very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.53,0:36:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我国就非常糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are so very bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.22,0:36:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们深信你们公平\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have this belief that you are so fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.01,0:36:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们非常无情\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are so cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.52,0:36:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都是谎话和谣传\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all lies and false propaganda.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.36,0:37:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是为了支持这个敌对的及暴力的政府！\N{\fnArial\fs30}to support this antagonistic and violent government!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.79,0:37:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,「暴力」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Violent"?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.53,0:37:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没有用机关枪来恐吓人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't keep our people behind a wall with machine guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.00,0:37:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？- 我是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - Who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.44,0:37:13.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是不沉默的大多数 大嘴怪！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the unsilent majority, big mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.37,0:37:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,说得好！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.04,0:37:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,侮辱我们！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, insult us!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.44,0:37:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是典型的对待外国人的无礼表现\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's more typical rude behavior toward visiting foreigners.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.48,0:37:25.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者这次击败 这个所谓冠军的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}But perhaps this simple defeat of this little so-called champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.05,0:37:27.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,会是一个非常好的例子\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be a perfect example.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.49,0:37:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明你们的社会已变得多么无能\N{\fnArial\fs30}of how pathetic and weak your society has become!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.12,0:37:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We go!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.07,0:37:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.17,0:37:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对到俄罗斯比赛有何感想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you feel about going to Russia?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.67,0:37:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这个受争议的决定有何看法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does it feel to be part of such a controversial decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.71,0:37:55.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因为奎迪的死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did Creed's death make up your husband's mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.21,0:37:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.02,0:37:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何要在圣诞节比赛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}why will fight in Christmas?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.02,0:38:00.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他决定的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it his decision?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.52,0:38:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何时会去俄罗斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will you go to Russia?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.85,0:38:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会去俄罗斯 我不知道你们在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going to Russia. I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.39,0:38:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道你们来做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}or what you people are doing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.06,0:38:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.83,0:38:46.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.96,0:38:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.83,0:38:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何这样做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.77,0:38:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是做我要做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just have to do what I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.77,0:38:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么也不需要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.98,0:39:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉 我需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Adrian, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.95,0:39:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还要离开这地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to leave this place too.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.32,0:39:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.79,0:39:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说让我到俄罗斯受训\N{\fnArial\fs30}They said they would let me train in Russia.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.59,0:39:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想到一个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to go someplace where.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.26,0:39:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里我不会想到别的事 除了奎迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't think of nothing except him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.13,0:39:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇 让时间冲淡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky, give it some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.03,0:39:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,别这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.20,0:39:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多人都同样活在痛苦中\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of people live with hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.20,0:39:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多人没有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adrian, a lot of people don't have the choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.04,0:39:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.24,0:39:31.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你愿意为此放弃所有东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And for that you're willing to lose everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.61,0:39:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉 这并非所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.28,0:39:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这房子 汽车 我们拥有的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This house and the stuff we have.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.52,0:39:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不是所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}ain't everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.75,0:39:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有许多东西的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a lot more than this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.39,0:39:46.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前你说要出赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before, there were reasons to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.86,0:39:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.06,0:39:49.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我今次不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't understand this.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.66,0:39:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使你赢了又如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if you win, what have you won?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.33,0:39:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波罗仍然死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apollo is still gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.97,0:39:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何你不可改变你的想法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why can't you change your thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.49,0:39:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一个人都可以改变！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody else does!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.30,0:39:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我是拳击手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I'm a fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.50,0:40:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的处事方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the way I'm made.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.31,0:40:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你嫁的就是这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you married.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.24,0:40:06.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们无法改变自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't change what we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.21,0:40:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.11,0:40:10.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法改变什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.01,0:40:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能按本性行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we can do is just go with what we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.22,0:40:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,按本性行事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cann't go with what we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.68,0:40:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看过报章了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you read the papers?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.19,0:40:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道大家怎样说吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what everybody says?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.29,0:40:19.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,是自杀！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody says it's suicide!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.16,0:40:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你见过他 知道他多强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen him. You know how strong he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.16,0:40:23.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你无法赢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't win!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.87,0:40:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾莉总是说出事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Adrian always tells the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.31,0:40:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 或许我无法赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I can't win.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.48,0:40:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许我唯一可以做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the only thing I can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.78,0:40:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,是尽力攻击他\N{\fnArial\fs30}is just take everything he's got.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.12,0:40:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但若要打败我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But to beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.29,0:40:51.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非把我打死\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll have to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.16,0:40:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,而若要打死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.46,0:40:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必要有胆量站在我面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'll have to have the heart to stand in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.20,0:41:01.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,而要这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.63,0:41:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须愿意牺牲自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}he has to be willing to die himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.40,0:41:08.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他会否准备好这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if he's ready to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.67,0:41:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.81,0:41:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.35,0:45:51.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,轻放那些格子皮箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful with the plaid ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.43,0:45:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们是主人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They belong to the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.73,0:45:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,保利 有带牙刷吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you pack your toothbrush?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.43,0:45:58.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,烟迹会残留在牙齿上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how tobacco stains your teeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.43,0:46:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已说过 我已告诉你许多次\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I've told you once, I've told you a thousand times.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.67,0:46:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别插话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop busting my chops.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.54,0:46:08.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,等我回来我会用电线绑住她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll have her wires tied when I get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.81,0:46:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你何时回来？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When will you be back?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.51,0:46:14.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.78,0:46:16.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你害怕吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:17.41,0:46:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不怕 - 不 你怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.78,0:46:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,有少许吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little maybe?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.92,0:46:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wouldn't you be?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.79,0:46:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,若一个巨人要打垮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}If a big giant man wanted to beat me up,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.32,0:46:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be real scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.30,0:46:35.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,坦白说 有时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}The truth is, sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.67,0:46:38.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的会有少许怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do get a little scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.64,0:46:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我在擂台上被狠揍\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I'm in that ring really getting hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.17,0:46:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我的手痛得提不起来时\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my arms hurt so much I can't lift them.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.33,0:46:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想“天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm thinking, "God,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.63,0:46:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望他揍我下巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish this guy would hit me on the chin,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.83,0:46:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么我再也没有感觉”\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I don't feel nothing anymore."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.64,0:46:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你内心的另一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then there's another side that comes out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:57.22,0:46:59.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,却不是那么怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}that isn't so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.41,0:47:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这另一面\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's another side.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.11,0:47:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,就想去继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}that wants to take more.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.18,0:47:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,想去继续多一个回合\N{\fnArial\fs30}that wants to go that one more round.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.79,0:47:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为继续多一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}because by going that one more roundwhen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.95,0:47:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为没可能的回合\N{\fnArial\fs30}you don't think you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.09,0:47:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,往往可以改变你一生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what makes all the difference in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.59,0:47:19.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白我的意思吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.73,0:47:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还想你记住一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you remember one more thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.80,0:47:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.74,0:47:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸认为你是世上最出色的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy thinks you're the best boy in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.31,0:47:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,无论怎样 爸爸一样爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Daddy loves you, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.93,0:47:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.27,0:47:46.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要照顾自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.81,0:47:50.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘记给你的机械人充电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget to feed your robot.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.24,0:47:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, babe.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.41,0:47:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.95,0:47:59.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.45,0:48:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,快些 收费仪在跳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! The meter's running!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.36,0:49:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次飞行真可怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a horrendous flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.60,0:49:22.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是俄罗斯？也不是太落后\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Russia? Don't look so tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.82,0:49:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.53,0:49:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备送你到住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take you to quarters now.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.70,0:49:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,太阳何时升起？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When does the sun come up?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.79,0:49:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这对我的鼻窦有害\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is detrimental to my sinuses.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.60,0:50:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,天气每小时都变动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weather changes hour to hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.73,0:50:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须要适应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.27,0:50:05.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,请上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in car now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.74,0:50:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,路途很遥远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have very long trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.25,0:50:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他像是吸血殭尸的表兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}He sounds like Dracula's cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.65,0:50:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,算了 保利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Paulie.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.81,0:51:13.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,符合你要求吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you requested, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.88,0:51:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要求这样荒芜的地方？- 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You requested this dumb location? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.88,0:51:20.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？你打算养驯鹿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? You planning to grow reindeer or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:21.65,0:51:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想远离世俗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just wanted to get away from things.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.09,0:51:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要求的设备\N{\fnArial\fs30}The equipment you requested.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:26.19,0:51:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在仓库内\N{\fnArial\fs30}is in barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.59,0:51:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是谁？- 「他们」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are they? - "They"?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.70,0:51:35.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是委派给你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are assigned to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.57,0:51:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你的官方监督人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Official chaperones.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.40,0:51:41.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们去哪儿 他们就去哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you go, they go.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.41,0:51:45.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个噩梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a bad dream here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.91,0:51:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 保利 没问题的 - 没问题？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay. - It's okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.18,0:51:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是给人住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is below human standards.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.32,0:51:52.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,连天线也没有 你得投诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no antennas. You have to complain.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.95,0:51:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会发疯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll crack out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.05,0:51:58.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已按指示 为你提供了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have everything I have been instructed to provide.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.59,0:52:00.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们任务已完成\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are finished, yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.60,0:52:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不投诉？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sparring?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.54,0:52:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不再需要了 保利\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I need it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.78,0:52:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有练拳手 没有电视 什么都没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sparring? No TV? Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.55,0:52:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在这里怎样训练？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the heck is he supposed to train around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.35,0:52:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有电视 怎样收看美式足球季后赛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No TV. What about the Rose Bowl game?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.42,0:52:32.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打赌一定也没有客房服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}No room service, I bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.36,0:52:34.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望他们把我的漫画送来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope they got my comics here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.76,0:52:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这假期真叫人沮丧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a depressing vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.60,0:52:46.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,岂有此理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.96,0:53:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,将军 朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Checkmate, friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.67,0:53:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 洛奇 我可以进来吗？- 可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Champ, can I come up? - Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.62,0:53:34.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.05,0:53:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.19,0:53:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样的天气真难忍受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some kind of weather we're having.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.32,0:53:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 的确很冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.22,0:53:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对于你来说却很适合\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for what you have to do it's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.66,0:53:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,使你更坚强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toughen you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.20,0:53:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.56,0:53:49.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你要自己在这儿做很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to do almost everything alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.67,0:53:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但是我不会离开你的 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but I'll be with you. - Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.30,0:53:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿波罗就像我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apollo was like my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:56.54,0:53:59.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我抚养他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I raised him.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.18,0:54:00.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.91,0:54:02.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,部分的我也死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}part of me died.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.98,0:54:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.15,0:54:06.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是唯一的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.95,0:54:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the one that's.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.82,0:54:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,会使他精神不灭 只有你\N{\fnArial\fs30}going to keep his spirit alive.You're the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.29,0:54:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以证明他不是死得没价值的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's going to make sure he didn't die for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.83,0:54:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将要熬过难关\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to go through hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.63,0:54:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这难关比你任何一个噩梦还要糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}worse than any nightmare you ever dreamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.23,0:54:23.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.73,0:54:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会是屹立不倒的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you'll be the one standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.94,0:54:30.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.01,0:54:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尝试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.22,0:54:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what you have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.29,0:54:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽力去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.06,0:54:48.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽力去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:54.53,0:54:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 杜克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.29,0:59:12.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法再离开你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't stay away any more.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.06,0:59:18.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很挂念你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.93,0:59:22.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也挂念你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.27,0:59:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论怎样 我都与你一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with you no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.50,0:59:29.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不论怎样」？\N{\fnArial\fs30}"No matter what?"
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.31,0:59:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No matter what.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:20.75,1:01:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,全力以赴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.02,1:01:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,全力以赴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.49,1:01:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,全力以赴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.34,1:04:02.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.48,1:04:09.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.86,1:04:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位好 我们在特别地方 祝大家圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, everybody, and Merry Christmas from a very unusual place.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.23,1:04:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是苏联的莫斯科\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in Moscow in the Soviet Union.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.80,1:04:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是汤巴里和班艾尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Barry Tompkins along with Al Bandiero.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.66,1:04:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这将是拳击界史上 最不容错过的赛事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This promises to be the most-watched event in boxing history.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.53,1:04:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来自美国的铁马鲍洛奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}The iron horse from America, Rocky Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.27,1:04:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.01,1:04:36.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,自从赌城的那次惨剧 阿波罗身亡后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since that tragedy in Las Vegas and the death of Apollo Creed.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.21,1:04:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就被冠以「天降的死神」这绰号\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago has been nicknamed Death From Above.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.45,1:05:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,台上站着是苏联总书记\N{\fnArial\fs30}The General Secretary of the Soviet.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:13.28,1:05:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,及政治局常委们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and other members of the Politburo.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.48,1:05:20.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,和其他已经就坐的成员 来观赏这场在莫斯科的\N{\fnArial\fs30}have made their way to their seats high above the ring here in Moscow.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.73,1:05:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知你现在没空闲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're busy just now.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.06,1:05:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想告诉你一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I want to tell you some things.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.66,1:05:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没说过的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never told you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:30.90,1:05:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知我有时做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know sometimes I act stupid.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.43,1:05:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,和说了一些愚蠢的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and say stupid things.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.67,1:05:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别人说「丢掉那个废物」时你仍留在我身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you kept me around when others would have said, "Drop that bum."
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.54,1:05:39.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你使我仍有自尊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You give me respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.74,1:05:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些话我很难说出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's hard for me to say these things.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.01,1:05:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为那不是我的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}because that ain't my way.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.21,1:05:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但若我可以做另一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if I could just be someone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.62,1:05:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想做你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd want to be you.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.79,1:05:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,因你充满了真心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're all heart, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.22,1:05:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 保利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Paulio.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.69,1:05:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在去好好教训那个家伙！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now blast this guy's teeth out!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.90,1:06:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll try.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.68,1:06:22.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一位拳手已经开始进场\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the fighters is starting to make his way toward the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.45,1:06:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听观众的叫声\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this crowd!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.62,1:06:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全是充满仇恨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This borders on pure hatred.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.69,1:06:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇毫无表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky's face absolutely like stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.56,1:06:31.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,他非常集中精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is the picture of concentration.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.63,1:06:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些嘘声似乎对他没半点影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}The booing crowd here does not seem to bother him one bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:35.30,1:06:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他今晚的眼神像是能穿透铅板\N{\fnArial\fs30}The champ has a look tonight that can burn through lead.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.00,1:06:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些嘘声完全没有影响他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The booing crowd has absolutely no effect on the man.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:41.77,1:06:44.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,他仍然非常集中精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}His concentration seems to be like stone.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.14,1:06:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.64,1:06:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们知道 - 你以为我们白痴的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We know. - We're not nerds.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.15,1:06:51.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听听观众的喊声 像疯了般\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to this crowd. It sounds insane.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:59.62,1:07:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,俄罗斯全国冠军出场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now the entrance of the Russian national champion.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:03.39,1:07:08.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡 他代表了整个国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ivan Drago, a man with an entire country in his corner.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.72,1:08:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看伊凡的表情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the expression on the face of Ivan Drago.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:03.72,1:08:07.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对观众的热情似乎无动于衷\N{\fnArial\fs30}He seems impervious to the madness of the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:07.09,1:08:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就如将要爆发的火山\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's like a volcano just waiting to erupt.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.16,1:08:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡冷静地跟总理点头示意\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Russian champion is amazingly cool as he acknowledges his premier.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.67,1:08:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要指出这是一场非认可的赛事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd like to point out again this is a non-sanctioned fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.60,1:08:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这并非锦杯赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not for the title.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.64,1:08:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,并没被美国拳击委员会认可\N{\fnArial\fs30}The American boxing commission has not sanctioned this bout.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.47,1:10:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:17.75,1:10:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真难以相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.75,1:10:22.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未见过这样怀有敌意的观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen such a hostile crowd.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.55,1:10:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这景象真教人难以相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an unbelievable sight to see.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:52.82,1:10:54.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们面对面地站着\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're toe-to-toe.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.66,1:10:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡比洛奇高大 这就是现代版的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Russian towers above the American It's a true case of.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.89,1:11:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,大卫对歌利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}David and Goliath.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.16,1:11:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,真难以置信的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}The condition of both men is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.70,1:11:07.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一定会打垮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must break you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.58,1:11:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我说过我想做你吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what I said back there about wanting to be you?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.31,1:11:18.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,忘了它吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.35,1:11:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 保利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Paulio.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.56,1:11:32.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别手下留情 要坚硬如石头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it straight to him and be a rock for me. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.56,1:11:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,要坚强 别输\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be strong!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.20,1:11:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他打败\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? Take it to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.60,1:11:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全力以赴 - 全力以赴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No pain. - No pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.04,1:11:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇 努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.41,1:11:45.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,铃声响了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the opening round bell.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.97,1:11:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇走到擂台中央\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky comes into the center of the ring.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.21,1:11:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇把伊凡逼到自己场角\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Russian way back into Balboa's corner now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.52,1:11:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走出来 - 突破他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of there! - Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.59,1:12:06.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一次 伊凡挥出刺拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once more, it's Drago backing up Rocky with a jab.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.16,1:12:10.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇失去平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balboa is not staying on balance.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:10.83,1:12:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因他被伊凡的刺拳击中\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of the Russian's long jab.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.14,1:12:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,保护好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brace yourself!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.34,1:12:22.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,双手提起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands up!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.68,1:12:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 揍他 - 立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Charge him! - Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.28,1:12:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他似乎无法触及伊凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't seem to touch the Russian!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.65,1:12:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇向伊凡进攻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky pounding away at the midsection of the Russian!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.22,1:12:34.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他竭尽所能狂揍\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hit him with everything he's got!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.49,1:12:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,而伊凡只对着他微笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago just smiled at him.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.93,1:12:41.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别停下来 - 继续出拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Keep chopping away! - Chop him down!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:45.53,1:12:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇 加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:48.37,1:12:50.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇似乎遇到很大麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky Balboa is in serious trouble!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.81,1:12:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须在未造成伤亡前中止比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}They might have to stop this one before somebody gets killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.08,1:12:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,打破他的节奏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Break his rhythm!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.05,1:13:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇受伤了 他吵醒这个巨人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky's hurt. He woke the sleeping giant.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.93,1:13:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在自讨苦吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he's paying the price.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.49,1:13:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡挥出右拳把洛奇抛到15英尺外\N{\fnArial\fs30}A solid hand from Drago sends Rocky Balboa 15 feet across the ring!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.79,1:13:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇倒下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the champ is down!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.10,1:13:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇 快起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky, get up!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.74,1:13:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,双手提起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.57,1:13:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,双手提起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hand up.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:29.31,1:13:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡继续狂揍鲍洛奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago continuing to punish Rocky Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.35,1:13:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,竭力不让他离开场角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hejust will not let him out of that corner!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:35.05,1:13:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇尽力赛完这一个回合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky Balboa is just trying to get through this first round.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.03,1:13:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡将洛奇如布偶般扔到自己的场角\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Russian just threw Balboa into his own corner like a rag doll.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.96,1:13:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,对洛奇来说这是个漫长的回合\N{\fnArial\fs30}A tough first three minutes for Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.33,1:13:55.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只面对无往不胜的对手\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not only fighting what appears to be an invincible opponenthe's.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.43,1:13:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有满怀敌意的观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}also fighting a very hostile crowd.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.14,1:14:01.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,而俄国总理和政治局成员都在看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Russian Premier and most of the Politburo are looking on.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.58,1:14:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's happening out there?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:03.95,1:14:05.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's winning.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.55,1:14:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见到三个他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see three of him out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:08.55,1:14:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,攻击中间那一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the one in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.82,1:14:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 揍中间那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, hit the one in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.83,1:14:15.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有照我的话做
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.69,1:14:18.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个美国人矮小又软弱
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.83,1:14:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,软弱
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.30,1:14:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,打击他的勇气 攻击他 他就会丧失勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take his heart. If you hurt him, you'll take his heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.70,1:14:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全力以赴 - 全力以赴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No pain. - No pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.60,1:14:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,打击他的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take his heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.70,1:14:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep working!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.87,1:14:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,铃声响了 比赛似乎是一面倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the bell for round two. It's been a one-sided fight so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.94,1:14:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇要赢必须靠些运气 他被狂揍\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will take more than luck for Rocky to survive this round.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.88,1:14:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇向他挥出勾拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky's been hit with bombs.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.04,1:14:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,躲闪 勾拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slip and hook!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.28,1:14:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇竭力留在台上对付伊凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balboa trying to stay in the middle of the ring against the big Russian.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.82,1:14:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,打他的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move the head!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.76,1:14:47.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,做你要做的事 对付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you get to do. Stay with him!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.63,1:14:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,全力以赴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pain!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.33,1:15:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.81,1:15:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇再次被击倒！他又起来了！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balboa goes down again! Bounces right back up!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.79,1:15:14.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,他快被打死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's getting killed!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.52,1:15:22.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇不断捱着伊凡的重拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky Balboa has taken Ivan Drago's best punches so far.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.39,1:15:24.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他受伤流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's cut and bleeding,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.03,1:15:28.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他仍站着继续比赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's on his feet and on the run.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.47,1:15:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,支持住\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's cut!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.81,1:15:34.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He dead!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.84,1:15:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡受伤了 严重的伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Russian's cut! It's a bad cut!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.14,1:15:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍洛奇现在反过来狂揍伊凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's Rocky Balboa coming after Ivan Drago!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.86,1:15:53.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可思议 继续打他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incredible! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.43,1:15:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡不想放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Russian wants to go on!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.13,1:16:01.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他抓住洛奇的喉咙\N{\fnArial\fs30}He grabs Balboa by the throat!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.33,1:16:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇抓起伊凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balboa picks up the Russian.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:04.04,1:16:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,如摔跤手般把他摔在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}and throws him to the ground like a wrestler!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.44,1:16:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是场混战！\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a gutter war!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.70,1:16:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫斯科的拳赛完全不设限！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No holds barred in Moscow!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.91,1:16:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇目前可能处于劣势\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky may be on the receiving end so far,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.31,1:16:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他却全力出击\N{\fnArial\fs30}but he's here to fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.51,1:16:15.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这像变了一场私人激战\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is shaping up to be a personal war.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.45,1:16:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,而此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.15,1:16:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这成了街头拳击赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's anybody's boxing match.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.82,1:16:22.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing good.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:22.15,1:16:25.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我自己不会做这么好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't do better myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.06,1:16:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎能这么做呢？
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.46,1:16:28.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他根本不算什么… 软弱
Dialogue: 0,1:16:28.53,1:16:30.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你伤他很严重 - 是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got him hurt bad. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.02,1:16:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在他开始担心 你伤了他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now he's worried. You cut him!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.26,1:16:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你伤了他！你打伤了他！\N{\fnArial\fs30}You hurt him! You hurt him!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.30,1:16:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到吗？看到吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see? You see?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.86,1:16:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是机器！他也是人！\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a machine! He's a man!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.10,1:16:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是人类
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.71,1:16:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就像是一块铁
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.64,1:16:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要打败他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want it more than he does!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.15,1:16:48.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 全力以赴 - 全力以赴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No pain! - No pain!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:50.02,1:16:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 别对他手下留情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Take it to him!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.91,1:17:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇狠狠的一个右拳！\N{\fnArial\fs30}A big right hand by Rocky Balboa!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.18,1:18:25.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're doing great.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.94,1:18:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一路走过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've come a long way.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:33.59,1:18:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 揍他 - 立刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Charge him! - Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.28,1:19:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,打他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punch him!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.68,1:19:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,放马过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:40.45,1:19:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些观众为洛奇打气\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few cheers now for Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.42,1:19:46.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫斯科突然支持洛奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suddenly Moscow is pro Rocky!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:58.57,1:20:00.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,全力以赴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.32,1:20:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续打他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep taking it to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:25.70,1:20:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场馆快要爆炸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Al, this place is ready to explode.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.00,1:20:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,双方拳来拳往\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lethal punch after punch!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.43,1:20:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,表现惊人的意志力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amazing willpower!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.64,1:20:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,双方都不放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither man backing off.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:32.10,1:20:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇的决心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky Balboa's determination.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.11,1:20:37.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始令观众倒戈相向\N{\fnArial\fs30}is actually winning over the once-hostile crowd.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.74,1:20:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,真想不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.98,1:20:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,第几个回合？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What round is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.08,1:20:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五 还有一个回合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fifteenth. One more round.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.22,1:20:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,已没什么可阻挡我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no stopping us now.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.63,1:20:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这回合属于我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our round.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.32,1:20:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No stopping now!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.03,1:20:54.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始了就不要停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You start, and you don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.06,1:20:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,要尽你所有的体力\N{\fnArial\fs30}All your strength!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:55.06,1:20:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,能力和爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}All your power! All your love!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.10,1:20:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拥有的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything you've got!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.63,1:21:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你训练这个白痴 他令我蒙羞
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.54,1:21:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听他们
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.04,1:21:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的同胞为他欢呼… 白痴
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.61,1:21:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,赢
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.05,1:21:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会战胜
Dialogue: 0,1:21:21.72,1:21:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我自己
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.66,1:21:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,为我自己
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.99,1:21:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把他击倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}To win, you have to knock him out!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:29.60,1:21:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不断挥拳直到无力为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Punch till you can't punch no more!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:33.10,1:21:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的一生就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is your whole life here!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.33,1:21:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,击倒他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock him out.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:37.30,1:21:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.50,1:21:41.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,铃声响了 战斗继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the bell. The war is on.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:41.87,1:21:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是最后一个回合\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the last round.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:48.41,1:21:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后决胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the end.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.92,1:21:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪一位拳手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which one of these fighters.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.18,1:21:56.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,能在这回合胜出？\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be standing at the end of this round?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.39,1:21:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡挥出狠狠的刺拳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago snaps out a stiff jab.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.52,1:21:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,再一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and another.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.73,1:22:01.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.99,1:22:03.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇处于下风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky taking punishment,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.72,1:22:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他企图避开他\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to get inside!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.36,1:22:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他已完全耗尽力气\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's completely exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.67,1:22:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油 攻击他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, cut him.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.57,1:22:12.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在等什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:19.11,1:22:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,打他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit him!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.75,1:22:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,放马过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, fight!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:46.47,1:22:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇狂揍伊凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Balboa is chopping the Russian down!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.71,1:22:58.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊凡挥出右拳突袭洛奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drago's hard right hand stuns Rocky Balboa.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.75,1:23:04.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,别倒下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't go down!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.09,1:23:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别倒下 - 走开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't go down. - Go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.56,1:23:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不讲求技术策略\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget technique. Forget strategy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:11.33,1:23:13.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一场街头激斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is just a street fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.53,1:23:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a question.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.34,1:23:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁的取胜心较大\N{\fnArial\fs30}of who wants it most.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.57,1:23:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在做什么 - 他快赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is he doing? - He's winning!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:22.71,1:23:25.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,打他身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the body!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:25.68,1:23:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.31,1:23:28.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.61,1:23:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,打破他的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}knock his head off!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.98,1:23:33.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇 打破他的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky, knock his head off!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:33.25,1:23:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油！干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Finish him!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.09,1:23:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.49,1:23:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,别停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.46,1:23:44.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.51,1:24:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,四\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.18,1:24:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,六\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.25,1:24:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛奇完成了不可能完成的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rocky Balboa has done the impossible.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.42,1:24:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众都为他欢呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and these people love it!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.86,1:24:17.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是一场混战\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is absolute pandemonium!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.23,1:24:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.54,1:25:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚到这里来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.91,1:25:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没期望过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I didn't know what to expect.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.61,1:25:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见到许多人憎恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've seen a lot of people hating me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.22,1:25:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道怎么去反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I didn't knowwhat to feel about that.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.52,1:25:20.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我也不喜欢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I guess I didn't like you much either.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.80,1:25:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在刚才比赛时\N{\fnArial\fs30}During this fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.23,1:25:30.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见到许多变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}I seen a lot of changing.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.91,1:25:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们对我的态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}the way you felt about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.61,1:25:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及我对你们的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the way I felt about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.38,1:25:48.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场馆里有两个拳手\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here, there were two guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:49.02,1:25:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,互相残杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}killing each other.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.09,1:25:55.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想这比二千万还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I guess that's better than 20 million.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.10,1:26:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想说的是\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm trying to say is.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.84,1:26:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我可以改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I can change.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.01,1:26:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也可以改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can change.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.38,1:26:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都可以改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}everybody can change!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.53,1:26:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想对我儿子说一句话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to say one thing to my kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.07,1:26:40.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他应该在家里睡着了 孩子 圣诞快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}who should be home sleeping. Merry Christmas, kid!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.97,1:26:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.81,1:26:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you!
